{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-spector-minimal.md","title":"Spector 极小度存在","display":"thm-spector-minimal — Spector 极小度存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-spector-minimal","aliases":["20-thm-spector-minimal"],"display":"thm-spector-minimal — Spector 极小度存在","chapter":"12","section":"12.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 12.5.1；Lemma 12.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[229,231,232],"source_printed_pages":[199,201,202],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal]]","[[20-df-e-splitting]]","[[20-lem-minimality-tree]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]","[[20-lem-black-restriction]]","[[20-lem-splitting-totality]]","[[20-lem-color-inheritance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-spector-minimal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-spector-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-spector-minimal — Spector 极小度存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 12.5.1；Lemma 12.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span><span>231</span><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span><span>201</span><span>202</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42322b2e4562a7f4\" href=\"?note=42322b2e4562a7f4\" title=\"20-lem-minimality-tree\">20-lem-minimality-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"13e4a40da6a20a5c\" href=\"?note=13e4a40da6a20a5c\" title=\"20-lem-black-restriction\">20-lem-black-restriction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"210dad0d9d959bef\" href=\"?note=210dad0d9d959bef\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-totality\">20-lem-splitting-totality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0fdc06d93e560f03\" href=\"?note=0fdc06d93e560f03\" title=\"20-lem-color-inheritance\">20-lem-color-inheritance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 是二次跳跃度。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42322b2e4562a7f4\" href=\"?note=42322b2e4562a7f4\" title=\"20-lem-minimality-tree\">20-lem-minimality-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"13e4a40da6a20a5c\" href=\"?note=13e4a40da6a20a5c\" title=\"20-lem-black-restriction\">20-lem-black-restriction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"210dad0d9d959bef\" href=\"?note=210dad0d9d959bef\" title=\"20-lem-splitting-totality\">20-lem-splitting-totality</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0fdc06d93e560f03\" href=\"?note=0fdc06d93e560f03\" title=\"20-lem-color-inheritance\">20-lem-color-inheritance</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spector\\text{-}minimal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}spector\\text{-}minimal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 判断当前全函数树中是否有 e-黑节点；有则限制到该节点，没有则有效分裂程序生成全 e-白子树。嵌套选择得到路径。原书的非可计算性引理保证非零；极小度不能等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 是其非零严格下度。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 12.5.1；Lemma 12.2.1；印刷页 199, 201, 202；PDF 第 229, 231, 232 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：每阶段使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\prime\\)</span> 判定是否存在黑节点；黑情形选一个严格延伸的黑节点并限制，白情形调用无 oracle 分裂程序并选一个子值。根串严格增长，所有旧黑白需求由保持引理继续成立。递归得到的路径可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\prime\\)</span> 读出；极小性引理含非零性，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\prime\\)</span> 的非零严格下度，故所得度严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\prime\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-minimality-tree","status":"resolved","id":"42322b2e4562a7f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-minimality-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-splitting-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-black-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"13e4a40da6a20a5c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-splitting-totality","status":"resolved","id":"210dad0d9d959bef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-splitting-totality]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-color-inheritance","status":"resolved","id":"0fdc06d93e560f03","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt